        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "This itinerary takes you through Panama’s capital, coasts and highlands. Start with Panama City, the Panama Canal, Chagres National Park and the San Blas archipelago. Then head to Boca Chica on the Pacific coast, make your way up to Barú Volcano, visit a coffee plantation in Boquete and finish your trip on the Caribbean islands of Bocas del Toro."
